    "text": "Suppose <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math> be a differentiable function such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>y</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8704;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>, If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>3</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>320</mn></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mn>5</mn></munderover><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>n</mi></mfenced></math> is equal to:",
